      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer basket contains 1P + multiple 3P items
Frequency: Per order
Volume: ~10–25% of baskets multi-seller
Owner: Marketplace Manager
Participants: Marketplace Mgr, Ecommerce (links to VS-10), CS (links to VS-13), OMS (links to VS-60)
Source: workflow W3149 — Multi-Seller Basket Split, Consolidation &amp; Customer Experience</bpmn:documentation>
