      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W3149_Task6" name="Ecommerce (links to VS-10) shows customer clear basket view: per-seller…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Ecommerce (links to VS-10) shows customer clear basket view: per-seller grouping, separate shipping thresholds/fees, estimated delivery windows, consolidated vs. split-shipment options where possible
Responsible (R): Ecommerce / System
Accountable (A): Marketplace Manager
Duration: Per order</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3149_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3149_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W3149_Task7" name="OMS (links to VS-60) orchestrates split: per-seller sub-orders with their…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: OMS (links to VS-60) orchestrates split: per-seller sub-orders with their respective fulfillment paths; where consolidation beneficial, route via Fulfill-by-BuildRight (links to VS-93) consolidation point
Responsible (R): OMS / System
Accountable (A): Marketplace Manager
Duration: Per order</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3149_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3149_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W3149_Task8" name="CS (links to VS-13) manage multi-seller order inquiries with unified order…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: CS (links to VS-13) manage multi-seller order inquiries with unified order view; communicate any per-seller delivery variance; reconcile returns/refunds per seller (W3151)
Responsible (R): CS / System
Accountable (A): Marketplace Manager
Duration: Per inquiry</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3149_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3149_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
