        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-515 (ensure controlled execution — Marketplace Catalog, Order Routing &amp; Seller Fulfillment (PA-95.2).) | - operational: real-time sync, atomic reservation, and stale-feed delisting
Owner: Marketplace Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
