    <bpmn:process id="W_W3151" name="W3151. Marketplace Returns, Seller Responsibility &amp; Disposition" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer initiates marketplace return
Frequency: Per return (~5–10% return rate)
Volume: Per marketplace order
Owner: Marketplace Manager
Participants: Marketplace Mgr, Seller, CS (links to VS-13), Quality, AP (links to VS-15)
Source: workflow W3151 — Marketplace Returns, Seller Responsibility &amp; Disposition</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3151_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3151_Lane1" name="CS">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3151_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3151_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3151_Lane2" name="Customer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3151_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3151_Lane3" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3151_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3151_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3151_Start5" name="Customer initiates marketplace return">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3151_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3151_Task6" name="CS (links to VS-13) log return request with reason; route to seller; per…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: CS (links to VS-13) log return request with reason; route to seller; per marketplace policy decide approval (auto-approve for low-value, seller-review for high-value); communicate decision to customer
Responsible (R): CS / Seller
Accountable (A): Marketplace Manager
Duration: Per return</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3151_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3151_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3151_Task7" name="Customer ships item back (to seller or BuildRight consolidation per policy); on…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Customer ships item back (to seller or BuildRight consolidation per policy); on receipt, seller inspects, files dispute if item not as returned; CS mediates disputes
Responsible (R): Customer / Seller / CS
Accountable (A): Marketplace Manager
Duration: Per return</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3151_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3151_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3151_Task8" name="On approval: refund customer (links to VS-80) and debit seller settlement…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: On approval: refund customer (links to VS-80) and debit seller settlement (W3153); item disposition (restock by seller, refurbish — links to VS-09, dispose per VS-73); track return rate per seller to scorecard (W3154)
Responsible (R): Finance / Seller
Accountable (A): Marketplace Manager
Duration: Per return</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3151_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3151_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3151_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3151_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3151_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-515 (ensure controlled execution — Marketplace Catalog, Order Routing &amp; Seller Fulfillment (PA-95.2).) | - operational: inspection, evidence capture, and serial tracking (links to VS-23)
Owner: Marketplace Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
